{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["要倚靠主，而非埃及"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那些下到埃及尋求幫助的人有禍了！",{"text":"他們仰賴戰馬，倚靠眾多的戰車和強壯的騎兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不仰望以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不尋求耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和華有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有能力降災，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從不食言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必懲罰惡人之家及其幫兇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人不過是人，並非上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的戰馬是血肉之軀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並不是靈。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華一伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些幫兇必踉蹌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受幫助的必跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必一同滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「猛獅守護獵物，發出咆哮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使叫來許多牧人一起攻擊牠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠也不會因他們的吶喊而懼怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不會因他們的叫嚷而畏縮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同樣，萬軍之耶和華必降臨在錫安山上爭戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必保護耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像飛鳥展翅保護幼雛一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必護衛它，搭救它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必越過它，解救它。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以色列人啊，你們已經嚴重悖逆耶和華，現在歸向祂吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，你們都要拋棄自己罪惡雙手製造的金銀偶像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「亞述人必喪身刀下，但並非人的刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必被刀吞噬，但並非凡人的刀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必逃避這刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的青年必做苦役。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的堡壘必因恐懼而陷落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的將領一看見戰旗就驚慌失措。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的火在錫安，祂的火爐在耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}